# Assets for test
#################
*.pem
*.sig

# ...except selfcustody's public key, which is the trust anchor
# prebuild/fetch_firmware.sh verifies release signatures against. It is
# committed on purpose: a key fetched at build time is only as trustworthy
# as the branch it is fetched from, and would not be reviewable here.
!selfcustody.pem

